## Setup

Run each portion independently.

### Frontend

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

### Backend

```bash
cd backend
npm install
npm run dev
```

### AI Service

```bash
cd ai
pip install -e .
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

### Contracts

```bash
cd contracts
cargo test
```

